  "bio": {
    "text": "Urijah Christopher Faber is an American former mixed martial artist and actor. He competed in the bantamweight and featherweight divisions of the Ultimate Fighting Championship (UFC), having competed for the UFC Bantamweight Championship on three occasions, and the featherweight division of the World Extreme Cagefighting (WEC), where he is a former WEC featherweight champion. He is the founder of Team Alpha Male.",
